OK, here's what I've figured out so far:

/etc/securettys:		list of login devices for root login.

/etc/auth/system/ttys:		C2 sec. file describing login devices.
				This includes max_tries, unsuc_login.

/etc/auth/system/devassign:	Describes devices??? What is this for?

Nix.




