As far as I know, DU 4.0 doesn't contain these functions.

Your DU 4.0 media kit (assuming you have one !) should contain four
CD's, one of which will contain on-line versions of the manuals.

If you're looking for those sort of security features on DU, DEC will no
doubt point you at the Digital/AltaVista Firewall for DU. It's an
expensive solution though (up to $15,000 for an unlimited licence !),
and you need to dedicate a machine to the task - running anything else
on the machine could compromise the firewall's integrity.

However, if you're looking at NAT/Masquerading merely to conserve IP
addresses, it's overkill.

Chris
